  message: "User-specified output format when unread human messages detected:\n\n```\nYour addition to the Activity/Discussion for this item comes after an unread message from the human:\n<message>\n\nFor context, here is the full Activity/Discussion transcript preceding that latest unread message:\n<whole rest of prior transcript>\n\nPlease reply to the human's message using `tracker discuss`.\n```\n\nImplementation notes:\n- Check whether most recent discussion entry before the new action has by: human\n- Print the warning to stdout (not stderr) so the agent sees it\n- Applies to: discuss command, update --note, and any future discussion-modifying commands\n- The heuristic aligns with AGENTS.md single-agent assumption for unread detection"  # 62f3
